  "question": "Let $f(x)=c\\sin(x)$ for all $x\\in\\mathbb R$. Suppose $f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{f(x+k\\pi)}{2^k}$ for all $x\\in\\mathbb R$. Then",
